          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "또 만났네, 「개척」의 작은 회색 새♭",
          "next": [
            202120001
          ]
        },
        "202120001": {
          "id": 202120001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "네가 또 날 깨웠구나",
          "next": [
            202120002,
            202120004,
            202120005
          ]
        },
        "202120002": {
          "id": 202120002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "일어나——",
          "next": [
            202120003
          ]
        },
        "202120003": {
          "id": 202120003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "새 옷이 도착했고, 스카우터가 찾아왔어. 네가 가장 좋아하는 주스는 로빈과 콜라보를 했고——",
          "next": [
            202120007
          ]
        },
        "202120004": {
          "id": 202120004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "이 시간부터 몽유병 증상이 시작된 거야?",
          "next": [
            202120007
          ]
        },
        "202120005": {
          "id": 202120005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "계정 전환하는 거 잊지 마",
          "next": [
            202120006
          ]
        },
        "202120006": {
          "id": 202120006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "지금은 한밤중이라고",
          "next": [
            202120007
          ]
        },
        "202120007": {
          "id": 202120007,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "next": [
            202120008
          ]
        },
        "202120008": {
          "id": 202120008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "난 그저 너랑 작은 거래를 하러 온 거야",
          "next": [
            202120009
          ]
        },
        "202120009": {
          "id": 202120009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "내 손에… 아직 네 「기억」이 있거든. 그게 공개되는 걸 원하는 건 아니겠지?",
          "next": [
            202120010,
            202120011
          ]
        },
        "202120010": {
          "id": 202120010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "어디 자세히 한번 말해 봐",
          "next": [
            202120012
          ]
        },
        "202120011": {
          "id": 202120011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "난 떳떳하니 두려울 게 없어",
          "next": [
            202120012
          ]
        },
        "202120012": {
          "id": 202120012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "넌 실연당한 드로마스를 몰래 따라가서, 방심한 틈을 타 함께 사진을 찍었어. 현인은 사랑에 빠지지 않는다는 셀카를 남긴 거지",
          "next": [
            202120013
          ]
        },
        "202120013": {
          "id": 202120013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "넌 길가의 점쟁이한테 점을 보고, 노점 앞에서 내 운명은 내가 만든다는 셀카를 남겼어",
          "next": [
            202120014
          ]
        },
        "202120014": {
          "id": 202120014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "넌 산책을 나갔다가 우연히 음유시인을 만났고… 그 자리에서 랩을 선보이고는 셀카 한 장을 남겼지",
          "next": [
            202120015
          ]
        },
        "202120015": {
          "id": 202120015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "넌 아침에 머리가 헝클어진 채로 셀카를 한 장 찍었어",
          "next": [
            202120016
          ]
        },
        "202120016": {
          "id": 202120016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "요즘 살이 좀 찐 것 같아서 넌 셀카를 한 장 찍었어",
          "next": [
            202120017
          ]
        },
        "202120017": {
          "id": 202120017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202120018,
            202120019,
            202120020
          ]
        },
        "202120018": {
          "id": 202120018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "그만, 우리한테 「망각」의 힘이 좀 필요하겠네",
          "next": [
            202120023
          ]
        },
        "202120019": {
          "id": 202120019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "멋지지 않아?",
          "next": [
            202120023
          ]
        },
        "202120020": {
          "id": 202120020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "하아, 조용히 하려 했는데 들켜 버렸네",
          "next": [
            202120021
          ]
        },
        "202120021": {
          "id": 202120021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "그건 다 Mar. 7th를 위해 찍은 사진이야",
          "next": [
            202120022
          ]
        },
        "202120022": {
          "id": 202120022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "말해 봐, 내 「기억」을 돌려받으려면 뭘 해야 하지?",
          "next": [
            202120023
          ]
        },
        "202120023": {
          "id": 202120023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "훗, Mar. 7th도 이제 다 알아♭",
          "next": [
            202120024
          ]
        },
        "202120024": {
          "id": 202120024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "포토월에서 이런 사진을 보기 싫으면… 간단해, 작은 회색 새♭",
          "next": [
            202120025
          ]
        },
        "202120025": {
          "id": 202120025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1413,
          "text": "Mar. 7th가 내일 점심에 깨어나면, 갓 구워낸 맛있는 음식이 눈앞에 있으면 좋겠어",
          "next": [
            202120026,
            202120027
          ]
        },
        "202120026": {
          "id": 202120026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "잘 자, Mar. 7th. 꿈속에서는 소원을 빌 수 있어",
          "next": [
            202120028
          ]
        },
        "202120027": {
          "id": 202120027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "알겠어, 에버나이트",
          "next": [
            202120028
          ]
        },
        "202120028": {
